#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Don't run with scissors."
msgstr "Knief, Gavel, Scheer un Licht, is för lütte Kinners nich."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Never trust car salesmen or politicians."
msgstr "Troo nienich Bruuktwagenhökers un Politikers."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Real programmers don't comment their code. It was hard to write, it should be hard to understand."
msgstr "Richtige Programmschrievers kommenteert ehr Kode nich. De weer vigeliensch to schrieven, de schall ok swoor to verstahn wesen."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "It is much easier to suggest solutions when you know nothing about the problem."
msgstr "Dat is veel eenfacher, en Utweg to wiesen, wenn een nix vun't Problem versteiht."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "You can never have too much memory or disk space."
msgstr "Du kannst nienich noog Spieker oder Fastplaatplatz hebben."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "The answer is 42."
msgstr "De Antwoort heet \"42\"."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "It's not a bug. It's a misfeature."
msgstr "Dat is keen Programmfehler, dat is en Fehlverhollen."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Help stamp out and abolish redundancy."
msgstr "Hölp bi't Wegdoon un Quittwarrn vun nich nödige Wedderhalen."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "To maximize a window vertically, click the maximize button with the middle mouse button."
msgstr "Wenn Du dat Finster pielrecht maximeren wullt, klick mit den Middel-Muusknoop op den Maximeren-Knoop."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "You can use Alt+Tab to switch between applications."
msgstr "Mit Alt+Tab kannst Du twischen Programmen wesseln."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Press Ctrl+Esc to show the applications running in your current session."
msgstr "Strg+Esc wiest de aktuell in den Törn lopen Programmen."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Alt+F2 displays a small window that you can type a command into."
msgstr "ALt+F2 wiest en lütt Finster för't Ingeven vun Befehlen."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Ctrl+F1 to Ctrl+F8 can be used to switch virtual desktops."
msgstr "Ctrl+F1 to Ctrl+F8 kann för't Wesseln vun den virtuellen Schriefdisch bruukt warrn."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "You can move buttons on the panel using the middle mouse button."
msgstr "Mit den Muusknoop in de Merrn kannst Du Knööp in't Paneel verschuven."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Alt+F1 pops-up the system menu."
msgstr "Alt+F1 maakt dat Systeemmenü op."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "Ctrl+Alt+Esc can be used to kill an application that has stopped responding."
msgstr "Strg+Alt+Esc kann för't Beennen vun ophungen Programmen bruukt warrn."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "If you leave KDE applications open when you logout, they will be restarted automatically when you log back in."
msgstr "Wenn KDE-Programmen bi't Afmellen apen weern, warrt disse automaatsch na en Nieganmellen wedder start."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid "The KDE file manager is also a web browser and an FTP client."
msgstr "De KDE-Dateipleger is ok en Nettkieker un en FTP-Programm."

#. +> trunk stable
msgid ""
"Applications can display messages and tips in an Amor bubble using the showMessage() and\n"
"showTip() DCOP calls"
msgstr ""
"Programmen köönt Narichten un Tipps in'n Spreekblaas wiesen.\n"
"Dor kann Een de DCOP-Oprööp \"showMessage()\" un \"showTip()\" för bruken"

